{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ever felt the immense satisfaction of a crunchy leaf under your foot?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide your feline friend by moving the mouse cursor - your playful fairy companion - as you frolic through a cozy, leaf-strewn forest in <i><strong>Cozy Crunch</strong></i>, a whimsical adventure where every satisfying crunch brings you closer to new rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re here for the leaf-crunching ASMR or to max out every upgrade, <i><strong>Cozy Crunch</strong></i> offers a comforting, playful escape into nature\u2019s coziest corners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pounce on crunchy leaves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/4802a9fc4eb0f6b26f3b868cc1fd6403.poster.avif?t=1751308391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/4802a9fc4eb0f6b26f3b868cc1fd6403.webm?t=1751308391\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect hidden treasures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/4b9bfc0f4f0fc4a7eb936afd498c1b6f.poster.avif?t=1751308391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/4b9bfc0f4f0fc4a7eb936afd498c1b6f.webm?t=1751308391\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive wild winds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/c791c22e1abccfb929c579b437d3bfa5.poster.avif?t=1751308391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721660/extras/c791c22e1abccfb929c579b437d3bfa5.webm?t=1751308391\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Satisfying progression.</strong> Start with a gentle stroll, but once you crunch that first leaf, you\u2019ll crave more. MORE. FASTER. <i>CRUNCHIER.</i> Unlock powerful upgrades and transform into an unstoppable leaf-crunching beast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a magical forest.</strong> Journey through four hand-crafted regions, each with its own secrets, challenges, and rare leaves to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cozy original soundtrack.</strong> Relax into the warm atmosphere with music that adapts to your pace and mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intuitive controls.</strong> Move your mouse, and your curious kitty will follow. It's that simple. It's that satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist <i><strong>Cozy Crunch</strong></i> and prepare to leaf your worries behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi! I\u2019m Jo, a solo indie developer, and this is my first game. Cozy Crunch is inspired by the charm of classic online flash games. Simple, relaxing, and designed to be enjoyed in a single cozy evening. I hope it brings you a bit of calm and delight, just like it did for me while creating it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721660?t=1751308391","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721660?t=1751308391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_